cted\n\n$620.00\nADD 3 PIECES TO BAG | $620.00\n\nSPECIFICATIONS / 06\n\n“\nForm follows material discipline.\n\nEvery component is specified for durability, utility and honest tactile feedback.\n\nINSPECT COLLECTION\n\nTECHNICAL REPORT / 01\n\nMATERIAL\nFull-grain calfskin, vegetable tanned in Tuscany\n01\nHARDWARE\nMachined from solid brass rod, unplated\n02\nTOLERANCE\n0.5mm edge painting and saddle stitching\n03\nLONGEVITY\nDesigned to gather character and patina\n04\n\nEDITION NOTES\n\nNew studies, occasionally\n\nProduct releases, material studies and measured updates.\n\nEmail address\nSUBSCRIBE\nSartorial Edition\n\nPRIVATE CORRESPONDENCE\n\nNotes from the studio\n\nNew objects, material studies and private previews, sent with restraint.\n\nEmail address\nSUBSCRIBE\nSearch\nRefund policy\nShipping policy\nPrivacy policy\nTerms of service\nContact information\nAccepted payment methods\n© 2026 Sartorial Edition\nPowered by Shopify",
